---
---

<section
  class="bg-lavender-50 border-y border-lavender-200"
  aria-label="Press and media features"
>
  <div class="container-narrow py-10 sm:py-12">

    <!-- Eyebrow label -->
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-purplePrimary mb-6 text-center sm:text-left">
      As Featured In
    </p>

    <!-- Three-column layout: publication · description · CTA -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-6 sm:gap-10">

      <!-- Publication name -->
      <div class="shrink-0 sm:w-36 text-center sm:text-left">
        <p class="text-xl font-light text-ink leading-tight tracking-tight">Voyage<span class="text-purplePrimary font-normal">Denver</span></p>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink/60 font-light mt-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest">Magazine</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Divider (desktop only) -->
      <div class="hidden sm:block w-px self-stretch bg-lavender-300 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="flex-1 text-sm sm:text-base text-ink/80 font-light leading-relaxed">
        Rae McGee was recently featured in VoyageDenver Magazine in a conversation about human-centered music education, creative learning, and building confidence through meaningful, joyful instruction.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA button -->
      <div class="shrink-0 sm:text-right">
        <a
          href="https://voyagedenver.com/interview/daily-inspiration-meet-rae-mcgee"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-secondary text-sm px-5 py-2.5"
          aria-label="Read the VoyageDenver interview with Rae McGee (opens in new tab)"
        >
          Read Interview
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
